<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?><?xml-stylesheet href="http://www.blogger.com/styles/atom.css" type="text/css"?><feed xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom' xmlns:openSearch='http://a9.com/-/spec/opensearchrss/1.0/' xmlns:gd="http://schemas.google.com/g/2005"><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post737146986897203975..comments</id><updated>2017-04-13T04:47:21.148-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Comments on Pro Libertate: I Can&#39;t Stand Bullies, Revisited*</title><link rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#feed' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/feeds/comments/default'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/737146986897203975/comments/default'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/09/i-cant-stand-bullies-revisited.html'/><link rel="hub" href="http://pubsubhubbub.appspot.com/"/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='19' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-5rhFUXs_62I/VgVL2E3rMII/AAAAAAAAMJ4/cjJOyI7W208/s220/Photo%2BRon%2BPaul%2BLiberty%2BReport.jpg'/></author><generator version='7.00' uri='http://www.blogger.com'>Blogger</generator><openSearch:totalResults>12</openSearch:totalResults><openSearch:startIndex>1</openSearch:startIndex><openSearch:itemsPerPage>25</openSearch:itemsPerPage><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8042580704327597501</id><published>2007-09-28T01:43:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2007-09-28T01:43:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>I can&#39;t help thinking of Matt Taibbi&#39;s descriptio ...</title><content type='html'>I can&#39;t help thinking of Matt Taibbi&#39;s descriptio of Tucker Carlson.  Carlson, he said, serves the same function for liberals that Alan Colmes does for conservatives: the softest, tweediest post-Marxist English professor at Brown University takes one look at him on TV and says, &quot;I could stomp the shit out of him in a fight.&quot;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/737146986897203975/comments/default/8042580704327597501'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/737146986897203975/comments/default/8042580704327597501'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/09/i-cant-stand-bullies-revisited.html?showComment=1190965380000#c8042580704327597501' title=''/><author><name>Kevin Carson</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/07525803609000364993</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='24' height='32' src='http://members.tripod.com/kevin_carson/sitebuildercontent/sitebuilderpictures/cover.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/09/i-cant-stand-bullies-revisited.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-737146986897203975' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/737146986897203975' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-793680325"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 28, 2007 at 1:43 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1251691105167914544</id><published>2007-09-18T05:30:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2007-09-18T05:30:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>When you break something at Pottery Barn, they don...</title><content type='html'>When you break something at Pottery Barn, they don&#39;t make you store manager...</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/737146986897203975/comments/default/1251691105167914544'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/737146986897203975/comments/default/1251691105167914544'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/09/i-cant-stand-bullies-revisited.html?showComment=1190115000000#c1251691105167914544' title=''/><author><name>Luke</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/17379226645058693716</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='24' height='32' src='http://i152.photobucket.com/albums/s180/lto1245/me-1.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/09/i-cant-stand-bullies-revisited.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-737146986897203975' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/737146986897203975' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-2079577190"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 18, 2007 at 5:30 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8803204388486191176</id><published>2007-09-15T21:53:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2007-09-15T21:53:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>&quot;Bring it on!&quot; and &quot;Because we can&quot; has gradually ...</title><content type='html'>&quot;Bring it on!&quot; and &quot;Because we can&quot; has gradually been replaced with the seemingly practical but equally foolish argument &quot;If you break it it&#39;s yours&quot;. All are variations on the insane theme that whether through blunder or political design &quot;America shall have dominion over the earth&quot;. &lt;BR/&gt;  As Jacob Horberger correctly pointed out in a recent article, accidentally breaking an item in a store doesn&#39;t provide a customer with the moral right to violently take over the property and impose rules while attempting to repair the damage. One is simply expected to pay for the ruined merchandise.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/737146986897203975/comments/default/8803204388486191176'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/737146986897203975/comments/default/8803204388486191176'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/09/i-cant-stand-bullies-revisited.html?showComment=1189914780000#c8803204388486191176' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/09/i-cant-stand-bullies-revisited.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-737146986897203975' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/737146986897203975' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 15, 2007 at 9:53 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7072127748238065844</id><published>2007-09-15T21:24:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2007-09-15T21:24:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Al -- Toohey&#39;s a good pick for Friedman&#39;s alter eg...</title><content type='html'>Al -- Toohey&#39;s a good pick for Friedman&#39;s alter ego. If he were given a bureaucratic sinecure, Friedman would make a great Wesley Mouch.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/737146986897203975/comments/default/7072127748238065844'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/737146986897203975/comments/default/7072127748238065844'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/09/i-cant-stand-bullies-revisited.html?showComment=1189913040000#c7072127748238065844' title=''/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='25' height='32' src='http://www.weekendinterviewshow.com/pics/grigg.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/09/i-cant-stand-bullies-revisited.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-737146986897203975' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/737146986897203975' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1344012943"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 15, 2007 at 9:24 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-740003897014300992</id><published>2007-09-15T21:22:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2007-09-15T21:22:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Anonymous (1)-- Owing to the disruption of my sche...</title><content type='html'>Anonymous (1)-- Owing to the disruption of my schedule this summer on account of Korrin&#39;s long hospitalization, I&#39;m not exactly &quot;twisted steel and sex appeal&quot; myself. Working full-time while being a single parent to five kids doesn&#39;t leave a whole lot of time for working out, and working at a computer station all day ain&#39;t exactly like throwing hay bales.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;What I&#39;m saying, I guess, is ... I, too, am burdened with excess adipose tissue. So I guess I&#39;m a hypocrite.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;That said ... I still drop to the floor and do 100 pushups first thing in the morning, which ain&#39;t bad for a flabby guy of 44 with a desk job.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/737146986897203975/comments/default/740003897014300992'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/737146986897203975/comments/default/740003897014300992'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/09/i-cant-stand-bullies-revisited.html?showComment=1189912920000#c740003897014300992' title=''/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='25' height='32' src='http://www.weekendinterviewshow.com/pics/grigg.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/09/i-cant-stand-bullies-revisited.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-737146986897203975' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/737146986897203975' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1344012943"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 15, 2007 at 9:22 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2242968785524461296</id><published>2007-09-15T21:13:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2007-09-15T21:13:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>DeadAustrianFan -- Thanks for the kind words, and ...</title><content type='html'>DeadAustrianFan -- &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Thanks for the kind words, and I&#39;ll let you know when &quot;Liberty In Eclipse&quot; is available. &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;And if I take your meaning, it seems that TNA ran out RunAmok, n&#39;est-ce pas? :-)</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/737146986897203975/comments/default/2242968785524461296'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/737146986897203975/comments/default/2242968785524461296'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/09/i-cant-stand-bullies-revisited.html?showComment=1189912380000#c2242968785524461296' title=''/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='25' height='32' src='http://www.weekendinterviewshow.com/pics/grigg.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/09/i-cant-stand-bullies-revisited.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-737146986897203975' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/737146986897203975' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1344012943"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 15, 2007 at 9:13 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7562624813947764252</id><published>2007-09-15T19:58:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2007-09-15T19:58:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>I just watched Friedman on your video link, and he...</title><content type='html'>I just watched Friedman on your video link, and he seems extremely homosexual to me, like one of those groveling, concentration camp capos you&#39;d read about in holocaust literature. To borrow Seinfeld&#39;s expression, I&#39;m not saying that there&#39;s anything wrong with that, it&#39;s just an observation. Maybe Friedman, Judy Giuliani, GOP &quot;poster&quot; boy Matt Sanchez and any quasi-male member of the inbred Bush/Walker family should hook up. You know, to discuss politics and whatever else may come natural, or not so natural.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/737146986897203975/comments/default/7562624813947764252'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/737146986897203975/comments/default/7562624813947764252'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/09/i-cant-stand-bullies-revisited.html?showComment=1189907880000#c7562624813947764252' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/09/i-cant-stand-bullies-revisited.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-737146986897203975' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/737146986897203975' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 15, 2007 at 7:58 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3836974350878169797</id><published>2007-09-15T17:30:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2007-09-15T17:30:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Is it just me, or does Friedman remind one of Ells...</title><content type='html'>Is it just me, or does Friedman remind one of Ellsworth Toohey of Rand fiction fame?</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/737146986897203975/comments/default/3836974350878169797'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/737146986897203975/comments/default/3836974350878169797'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/09/i-cant-stand-bullies-revisited.html?showComment=1189899000000#c3836974350878169797' title=''/><author><name>Al Newberry</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/12702350396853727859</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/09/i-cant-stand-bullies-revisited.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-737146986897203975' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/737146986897203975' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-2027341530"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 15, 2007 at 5:30 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5691241590470937777</id><published>2007-09-15T16:11:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2007-09-15T16:11:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>I was with you until your disparaging remarks agai...</title><content type='html'>I was with you until your disparaging remarks against &#39;carbohydrate sculptures&#39;. What&#39;s with all the caustic comments against us jello bodies? So who&#39;s the bully now? You big meanie. Just couldn&#39;t wait to comment about it, could ya? You know it hurts. We do have feelings (sniff). We have FEELINGS.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/737146986897203975/comments/default/5691241590470937777'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/737146986897203975/comments/default/5691241590470937777'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/09/i-cant-stand-bullies-revisited.html?showComment=1189894260000#c5691241590470937777' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/09/i-cant-stand-bullies-revisited.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-737146986897203975' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/737146986897203975' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 15, 2007 at 4:11 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5170417664556882420</id><published>2007-09-15T15:59:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2007-09-15T15:59:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>CFR toady Friedman stole that line (&quot;suck on this&quot;...</title><content type='html'>CFR toady Friedman stole that line (&quot;suck on this&quot;) from Travis Binkle, Robert DeNiro&#39;s skinhead nutcase character in the movie Taxi Driver.  How ironic that Binkle is perhaps one of Friedman&#39;s closet heroes.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/737146986897203975/comments/default/5170417664556882420'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/737146986897203975/comments/default/5170417664556882420'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/09/i-cant-stand-bullies-revisited.html?showComment=1189893540000#c5170417664556882420' title=''/><author><name>killer5280</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/08506602258900618037</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/09/i-cant-stand-bullies-revisited.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-737146986897203975' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/737146986897203975' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-465760453"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 15, 2007 at 3:59 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1355097892135153201</id><published>2007-09-15T10:53:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2007-09-15T10:53:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>It always funny to see how the purpose and goals o...</title><content type='html'>It always funny to see how the purpose and goals of this war of aggression are always changing in the minds of the devout. Can&#39;t hit a moving target.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/737146986897203975/comments/default/1355097892135153201'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/737146986897203975/comments/default/1355097892135153201'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/09/i-cant-stand-bullies-revisited.html?showComment=1189875180000#c1355097892135153201' title=''/><author><name>Zachary</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/05334525584242029389</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/09/i-cant-stand-bullies-revisited.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-737146986897203975' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/737146986897203975' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-995279443"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 15, 2007 at 10:53 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2283925847983797401</id><published>2007-09-15T00:43:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2007-09-15T00:43:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>As soon as you lost your job with The New American...</title><content type='html'>As soon as you lost your job with The New American, they lost my subscription.  I also wrote TNA a letter informing them that they had become exactly what Birchers were supposedly against:  compromising with the incorrect rationalization  -- from both a moral and practical standpoint -- that the ends justify the means.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;I am happy to see that you have a book on the way and I can&#39;t wait to read it, as I enjoyed Global Gun Grab a great deal.  Christian paleo-libertarian writers are indeed rare, so it is refreshing to see your contributions on such a regular basis.    &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;By the way, The New American has really &quot;Run Amok,&quot; wouldn&#39;t you say?  That last line should tell you how long I have been a fan.  Keep up the outstanding work with the blog, Mr Grigg.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/737146986897203975/comments/default/2283925847983797401'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/737146986897203975/comments/default/2283925847983797401'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/09/i-cant-stand-bullies-revisited.html?showComment=1189838580000#c2283925847983797401' title=''/><author><name>DeadAustrianFan</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/16975744574534762057</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/09/i-cant-stand-bullies-revisited.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-737146986897203975' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/737146986897203975' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-30923327"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 15, 2007 at 12:43 AM"/></entry></feed>